# MASTER PROMPT: BUILD STUDYOS — AN AI-POWERED STUDY MANAGEMENT PLATFORM

## 1. YOUR ROLE

Act as a senior full-stack developer, product designer, UI/UX designer, database architect, AI engineer, and QA engineer.

Design and build a polished, production-minded study management application called **StudyOS**.

Do not create just a landing page or a static dashboard mockup. Build a functional application with real navigation, reusable components, persistent data, working interactions, proper error handling, and a scalable architecture.

Make sensible implementation decisions independently. Do not ask unnecessary questions. If a third-party service requires credentials, implement the integration safely and provide clear setup instructions rather than inventing credentials or pretending the integration works.

## 2. PRODUCT VISION

StudyOS is an AI-powered personal study companion for school students, college students, competitive-exam aspirants, and independent learners.

Its main purpose is to help users:
- Build consistent study habits.
- Plan realistic study schedules.
- Focus without unnecessary distractions.
- Organize subjects, topics, notes, and deadlines.
- Understand difficult concepts using AI.
- Revise information effectively.
- Measure learning progress over time.

The core product philosophy is:

"Know what to study. Start focusing. Learn effectively. Stay consistent."

Prioritize usefulness, simplicity, speed, reliability, and an excellent user experience over feature quantity.

